ں پہنچے", "bn": "(যখন) তা তাদের আঘাত করে", "fa": "(وقتی) به آنان برسد"}}, {"text": "ٱلْبَغْىُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَنتَصِرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "2:156", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/163.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Who say, when a misfortune striketh them: Lo! we are Allah's and lo! unto Him we are returning.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar başlarına bir musibet geldiği zaman: \"Biz Allah'a aidiz ve sonunda O'na döneceğiz.\" derler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ جب ان پر کوئی مصیبت پڑے تو کہیں ہم اللہ کے مال ہیں اور ہم کو اسی کی طرف پھرنا-", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(yaitu) orang-orang yang apabila ditimpa musibah, mereka mengucapkan: \"Inna lillaahi wa innaa ilaihi raaji'uun\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِذَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَصَٰبَتْهُم", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/bc64099bec9929e4a41d.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "she/it struck them", "bs": "pogodila ih je", "tr": "onları vurdu", "fr": "elle les a frappés", "id": "dia telah menimpa mereka", "ur": "اُس نے انہیں مارا", "bn": "তা তাদের আঘাত করল", "fa": "آنان را دچار کرد"}}, {"text": "مُّصِيبَةٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِنَّآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَيْهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَٰ